            <ArticleTitle>[The role of gender medicine in rehabilitation].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>416-22</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article provides a coherent view of gender differences in rehabilitation medicine from the biological, individual and social perspective. It reports the role of gender in pain, in rehabilitation of the musculosceletal system and in rehabilitation of patients with prostate cancer.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
